{"id":"vod_sn_36491","vodId":"36491","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"回转企鹅罐","name_cn":"回转企鹅罐","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/45d9efa0b5a233d9d4b9f7ca402a1009.jpg"},"summary":"故事以高仓家三兄妹为中心而展开，高仓冠叶（木村昴  配音）、高仓晶马（木村良平 配音）兄弟俩和患有绝症的妹妹高仓阳毬（ 荒川美穂 配音）。　　有妹控情结的高仓兄弟俩都非常珍视阳毬，然而医生却让他们做好随时失去妹妹的准备。这天兄妹三人一同去水族馆游玩，可是一转眼兄弟二人发现妹妹不见了，随后他们在围观人群中央发现倒地不醒的阳毬。抢救无效被宣布死亡的阳毬竟然在停尸房里醒过来了！惊讶无比的兄弟俩把妹妹接回家，不久后他们收到了一份奇怪的包裹，打开后竟然发现里面有三只谜样企鹅。这三只企鹅憨态可掬，除了他们，外人都看不见这些企鹅。这一切究竟是怎么回事，命运的齿轮又会如何转动？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x71iZg6MPh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dSNvpX2w2q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CuF2EN28Ne1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PSa2jKHBVH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Ht0g9tLaD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pAaLyHny2X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6vzf8kLS5L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DgtBUJ0XDY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/isqn6dL0Hn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fDdc58vvD91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/81rvuTPN531/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ijareBRP1b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ytzm7UWa5i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D39MRXGpFC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","